@baseUrl = http://localhost/playstation/backend/public/api
@startNow = 2026-10-27T19:19:19
@startLater = 2026-10-27T22:00:00

### 1. Uji 409 DEVICE_OVERDUE (Console masih ditahan penyewa sebelumnya)
# Pada seeder DEMO0002, device_id 1 (SN-PS3-001) berstatus 'Overdue'.
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/create.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Budi Santoso",
  "phone": "081234567890",
  "start_time": "{{startNow}}",
  "payment_method": "QRIS",
  "items": [
    {
      "device_id": 1,
      "duration_hours": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Uji 409 SLOT_TAKEN (Jadwal bertumpuk dengan rental yang belum Returned)
# Pada seeder DEMO0001, device_id 2 (SN-PS3-002) dan device_id 3 (SN-PS4-001)
# sedang disewa ('Rented') dari 1 jam lalu sampai 1-3 jam ke depan.
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/create.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Budi Santoso",
  "phone": "081234567890",
  "start_time": "{{startNow}}",
  "payment_method": "QRIS",
  "items": [
    {
      "device_id": 2,
      "duration_hours": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 3. Uji 429 BOOKING_LIMIT_REACHED (Customer sudah punya 2 pesanan aktif)
# Nomor HP Sinta Dewi (082345678901) sudah memiliki 2 pesanan aktif di seeder:
# DEMO0002 (Overdue) dan DEMO0004 (Booked).
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/create.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Sinta Dewi",
  "phone": "082345678901",
  "start_time": "{{startNow}}",
  "payment_method": "QRIS",
  "items": [
    {
      "device_id": 4,
      "duration_hours": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Uji 201 Created + Pengurutan device_id Naik (Sukses Booking Multi-Item)
# Mengirim item dengan urutan device_id [4, 2] pada jam kosong (3 jam lagi).
# device_id 4 (SN-PS4-002) kosong karena DEMO0003 sudah 'Returned'.
# Perhatikan di response JSON: urutan items otomatis diurutkan menjadi [2, 4].
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/create.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Pelanggan Baru",
  "phone": "085678901234",
  "start_time": "{{startLater}}",
  "payment_method": "Transfer Bank",
  "items": [
    {
      "device_id": 4,
      "duration_hours": 2
    },
    {
      "device_id": 2,
      "duration_hours": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 5. Uji Double Booking di Jam yang Sama (Jalankan setelah Request #4 berhasil)
# Mencoba memesan kembali device_id 4 di jam yang sama dengan Request #4.
# Harus ditolak dengan 409 SLOT_TAKEN.
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/create.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Pelanggan Lain",
  "phone": "089988776655",
  "start_time": "{{startLater}}",
  "payment_method": "Cash",
  "items": [
    {
      "device_id": 4,
      "duration_hours": 2
    }
  ]
}